### 市政行道树修剪许可 API 验证脚本

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/pruning

### ========== 1. 查询所有树木档案 ==========
GET {{baseUrl}}/trees
Accept: application/json

### ========== 2. 验收路径：提交古树修剪申请并验证进入专家审批 ==========
### 2.1 提交古树名木（TR003 国槐，120年树龄）的修剪申请
# 预期：status = EXPERT_APPROVAL（自动进入专家审批）
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treeCode": "TR003",
  "applicant": "张工",
  "maintenanceUnit": "古树名木保护中心",
  "pruningReason": "枯枝存在安全隐患，需要修剪",
  "pruningScheme": "保留主枝，剪除枯死枝条",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-10",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-15",
  "occupyRoad": false
}

### 2.2 查询待专家审批的申请列表
# 预期：包含刚才提交的古树修剪申请
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/expert/pending
Accept: application/json

### ========== 3. 普通树木修剪申请流程（街道审核员复核） ==========
### 3.1 提交普通树木（TR001 悬铃木）的修剪申请
# 预期：status = STREET_REVIEW（进入街道审核）
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treeCode": "TR001",
  "applicant": "李工",
  "maintenanceUnit": "城维养护公司",
  "pruningReason": "树冠过密影响采光",
  "pruningScheme": "疏剪过密枝条",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-12",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-14",
  "occupyRoad": true,
  "roadSection": "中山路-东段"
}

### 3.2 街道审核员通过审核（假设上一步返回的申请ID为2）
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/street-audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auditor": "王审核",
  "approved": true,
  "opinion": "情况属实，同意修剪"
}

### ========== 4. 占道施工时间冲突验证 ==========
### 4.1 尝试提交另一个占道申请，时间与上一个重叠
# 预期：返回错误，提示占道施工时间冲突
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "treeCode": "TR002",
  "applicant": "赵工",
  "maintenanceUnit": "城维养护公司",
  "pruningReason": "树枝遮挡交通标志",
  "pruningScheme": "修剪遮挡枝条",
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-06-13",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-16",
  "occupyRoad": true,
  "roadSection": "中山路-东段"
}

### ========== 5. 完工照片验证（未上传不能关闭） ==========
### 5.1 先获取一个已完成施工的申请（假设申请ID为2）
# 先开始施工
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/start-construction

### 5.2 完成施工
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/complete-construction

### 5.3 尝试关闭许可（未上传照片）
# 预期：返回错误，提示未上传完工照片不能关闭许可
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/close

### 5.4 上传完工照片
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/photos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photoUrl": "https://example.com/photos/completion_001.jpg",
  "description": "修剪后整体效果",
  "uploader": "张工"
}

### 5.5 再次关闭许可（已上传照片）
# 预期：关闭成功，status = CLOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/2/close

### ========== 6. 查询施工路段 ==========
GET {{baseUrl}}/construction-sections
Accept: application/json

### ========== 7. 查询所有申请 ==========
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Accept: application/json
